{"title":"Thorn Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 48) · Monster drop: Kragg The Unmoved, Old Mother Ashka, Gutrot The Carver, Ogre Elder, Ogre Butcher +2 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 48 <span class=\"muted\">(2341 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>, 1× <a href=\"#/item/thorn-cutting\">Thorn Cutting</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"human\" title=\"Aldous Rime - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/78a323c45b96b969965c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Aldous Rime</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 4 of 73 looted corpses (1/18)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/18<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 4 of 74 looted corpses (1/19)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/19<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 2 of 75 looted corpses (1/38)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/38<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 2 of 1,292 looted corpses (1/646)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/646<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - dropped it in 1 of 685 looted corpses (1/685)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/685<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 760 looted corpses (1/760)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/760<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"thorn-arms\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/1f1604dc88f4e382bd7e.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/thorn-cutting\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/32fe2a6f1fb8885c9afb.svg\" alt=\"\">Thorn Cutting</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/e0c6f0d49af674afeae9.svg\" alt=\"Thorn Arms\"></div><h3>Thorn Arms</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 48</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>7 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/26/2026, 6:57:54 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}